OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe flow of patients at Barnsley
OL,7,     FCasualty is relentless and today
OL,8,     Fstaff are put under even more
OL,9,     Fpressure by patients suffering
OL,10,     Ffrom the effects of drink or
OL,11,     Fdrugs.
OL,12,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FAn alcohol-dependent patient is
OL,14,     Ftransferred to resus after a fall,
OL,15,     Fjust in time to intercept a
OL,16,     Fseizure, and a man with a
OL,17,     Fdislocated shoulder has a shocking
OL,18,     Freaction to pain medication.
