OL,5,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FMedics rush to a 60-year-old woman
OL,7,     Fwith suspected multiple injuries,
OL,8,     Ftrapped in her car, and to a
OL,9,     F36-year-old knife attack victim,
OL,10,     Fwho has extensive injuries to his
OL,11,     Fneck and face.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FA footballing dad brings a
OL,14,     Fhat-trick of lipomas for Dr Emma
OL,15,     Fand there's a big dilemma for Dr
OL,16,     FAdil's patient when he comes in
OL,17,     Fwith a lump that's next to a
OL,18,     Ftreasured Pink tattoo.
