OL,5,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,6,     FDental records show a corpse's
OL,7,     Fidentity to be a woman who
OL,8,     Fsupposedly died over three years
OL,9,     Fago from a brain aneurysm.
OL,10,G0100 Murdered at First Sight
OL,11,     FOn Feb 1, 2004, Carlie Brucia
OL,12,     Fdisappears walking home in
OL,13,     FSarasota, FL. Days later, her body
OL,14,     Fis found. Joseph Smith, a violent
OL,15,     Fex-con, is arrested for her
OL,16,     Fmurder.
OL,17,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,18,     FJunior Doctor Jake Mullen assesses
OL,19,     F44-year old Kay who arrives at the
OL,20,     Fhospital with flu-like symptoms.
OL,21,     FHe runs the risk of contracting a
OL,22,     Fhighly contagious strain of flu.
